  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIRCLE - Climate Impacts Research Capacity and Leadership Enhancement.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capacity of African researchers in high performing African research institutions by 2018 and give greater access to funding opportunities and internationally recognised knowledge and evidence on climate change.  This will result in greater support to research on climate change and its local impacts on development in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
